{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-11-10 10:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIR CARGO SELECTS BOEING TO CONVERT TWO PASSENGER AIRCRAFT TO FREIGHTERS', 'text': 'FIVE DEDICATED 737 CONVERTED FREIGHTERS TO MEET CARGO DEMAND ACROSS THE ALASKA NETWORK SEATTLE , NOV. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALASKA AIR CARGO ANNOUNCED BOEING WILL PROVIDE THE CONVERSION WORK FOR TWO 737-800 BOEING CONVERTED FREIGHTERS (BCF) TO ADD TO ITS DEDICATED FREIGHTER FLEET SERVING THE STATE OF ALASKA. THE CONVERSION WORK WILL BE DONE AT COOPERATIVA AUTOGESTIONARIA DE SERVICIOS AEROINDUSTRIALES (COOPESA) IN COSTA RICA.'}{'symbol': 'ALL', 'date': '2022-11-10 12:00:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE TO HOST SPECIAL TOPIC INVESTOR CALL ON CLAIMS, RESERVING', 'text': 'NORTHBROOK, ILL.'}{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2022-11-10 14:30:00', 'title': 'OFFERING UNMATCHED PERFORMANCE, LEADERSHIP ENERGY EFFICIENCY AND NEXT-GENERATION ARCHITECTURE, AMD BRINGS 4TH GEN AMD EPYC™ PROCESSORS TO THE MODERN DATA CENTER', 'text': "—NEW AMD EPYC™ PROCESSORS ARE THE WORLD'S FASTEST AND MOST ENERGY EFFICIENT, ALLOWING CUSTOMERS TO MODERNIZE THEIR DATA CENTERS TO DRIVE ACTIONABLE INSIGHTS FOR BETTER BUSINESS RESULTS—"}{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2022-11-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'AMEREN HIGHLIGHTS CLIMATE COMMITMENTS: NEW REPORT PROVIDES UPDATE ON COMPANY PROGRESS TOWARD ACHIEVING NET-ZERO CARBON EMISSIONS BY 2045', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , NOV. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE) RELEASED ITS LATEST CLIMATE REPORT ALIGNED WITH THE TASK FORCE ON CLIMATE-RELATED FINANCIAL DISCLOSURES (TCFD) RECOMMENDATIONS. THE REPORT HIGHLIGHTS ACTIONS THE COMPANY IS TAKING TO MANAGE CLIMATE-RELATED RISKS AND TRANSITION TO A CLEANER ENERGY FUTURE, ACHIEVING NET-ZERO CARBON EMISSIONS BY 2045.'}{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2022-11-10 17:35:00', 'title': 'AIG ANNOUNCES FIVE-YEAR EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT WITH PETER ZAFFINO', 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT AIG AND PETER ZAFFINO, PRE